        <div class="tip-box">
            <h4><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> After School Activity Tips</h4>
            <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px;">
                <li><strong>Balance (バランス):</strong> Keep a balance between studies and activities.</li>
                <li><strong>Time management (じかんかんり):</strong> Schedule homework time after activities.</li>
                <li><strong>Safety (あんぜん):</strong> Let your parents know where you are after school.</li>
                <li><strong>Friends (ともだち):</strong> Activities are a great way to make friends.</li>
                <li><strong>Participation (さんか):</strong> Join activities that interest you, not just for resume.</li>
                <li><strong>Rest (きゅうそく):</strong> Don't overdo it. Take breaks when needed.</li>
